{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-06-30 16:30:00', 'title': "SOCIÉTÉ GÉNÉRALE IS THE LATEST GLOBAL BANK TO JOIN BROADRIDGE'S DISTRIBUTED LEDGER REPO PLATFORM", 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVERAGING THE LATEST TECHNOLOGY TO FURTHER TRANSFORM ITS CAPITAL MARKET OPERATIONS, SOCIÉTÉ GÉNÉRALE, IS NOW LIVE ON THE DISTRIBUTED LEDGER TECHNOLOGY REPO PLATFORM (DLR) CREATED BY GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE:BR). THE BLOCKCHAIN-ENABLED PLATFORM ACCELERATES THE DIGITIZATION OF THE GLOBAL REPO MARKET, EMPOWERING PARTICIPANTS TO REALIZE IMMEDIATE BENEFITS OF REDUCED RISK AND OPERATIONAL COSTS AND ENHANCED LIQUIDITY.'}